Protection Spell Rework
Protection spells are now instant cast, short duration group buffs.
This should change their use from fire and forget buffs to something
a mages uses right before a fight or in response to a spell being cast.
- Protection from Elements renamed to protection from energy and now
provides immunity to energy
- Protection from water now provides cold immunity as well as water
- Protection from Air now provides electricity immunity as well as Air
- All protection spells moved from the mage disc to early in advanced
disciplines
